<title>NETHERLANDS: KNP BT 1997 FIRST QTR RESULTS BY SECTOR.</title>
<headline>KNP BT 1997 FIRST QTR RESULTS BY SECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997 KNP BT</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>SALES:</p>
<p>    -Distribution (billion)		  2.56   vs    2.23</p>
<p>    -Packaging				    779   vs     784</p>
<p>    -Paper production (KNP Leykam)	  546   vs     586</p>
<p>    -Miscellaneous			debit 174   vs     197 debit</p>
<p>    Total sales (billion)		    3.71   vs    3.41</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT:</p>
<p>    -Distribution				  61   vs	62</p>
<p>    -Packaging				     62   vs	79</p>
<p>    -Paper production (KNP Leykam)   profit 8   vs	 7 loss</p>
<p>    -Miscellaneous			loss    9   vs	 4 loss</p>
<p>    Total operating profit		    122   vs     130</p>
